# BUGFIX (QA-MKT-003): src/lib/config.ts falls back to https://api.ilesure.com when
# VITE_API_URL is unset, and no env file existed in this project at all, so a local or
# staging build posted real waitlist submissions (name, email, phone) to PRODUCTION,
# which does not answer. Nobody could join the waitlist, and tester PII was aimed at prod.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
